    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2832540299ca0f32f066a15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石难得事先询问起\n预定参赛“安田纪念”的人选。\n训练员能感受到她期待与劲敌一战的心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8aac0709d6abf825db79970233b70abbfa5a20bd2e3a63e162b42218bc32a3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085426.json",
      "json_path": [
