    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3da925b683f11bb38e9c3d2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下一场目标竞赛就决定是“安田纪念”了。\n两人立即开始为了新的目标动身准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab01942cd999927d0f0c0a73035b088a991131b466c2fad66910107012fd6996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5520079c32507b68786a9818",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高松宫纪念结束后・内心深处的火焰",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad166347962c9f3be12ac4f161f830247e04cb3a0fed2595932978956ec67c91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0135d00e4f56d5952f8223b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以最快速度冲刺的第一红宝石绽放了\n最耀眼的光芒。不仅是观众，\n连劲敌们也被那光芒深深吸引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a101a8762194df17e3d910e6e97d80c21c47475ad414becdd332e85839728c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a9b4f3cfb591ed00dfdadb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她知道何谓最耀眼的光芒。\n即是足以成为所有人目标的尊贵光芒。\n成为那道光正是他们一族的使命──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49c7b16de98aa342cde10c8271ef253ce9b55241cf70ae156021b45ce77dd91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fecd2c107924b202df2d16e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了到达那个境地，\n下个目标就决定是“短途马锦标”。\n不知不觉间，她的心中已燃起熊熊热情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dfd189a93dcf9e666989ac9bd12d215ac68231c7b134355d81c8d5597964c36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddbd5cb7b677dc70cd8f8593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，第一红宝石得知\n同样拥有惊人速度的凯斯奇迹\n也预计参加“短途跑者S”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "72267d37ae253e59144c02d12119eca77a32b12137e3df698e2ea9bfc571e7c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdbc85e43c3119776086543e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "安田纪念结束后・深红色是热情之色",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e2490e4a64545ba8a1f8a306167cd3780659555edccaa4543f876872e1c4307",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
