    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1755682727bced08a9a24d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石展现压倒性的速度获得胜利。\n她的跑姿在凯斯奇迹眼中\n正是最耀眼的一道光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "297629789a6ca98297e8b5851b24341d74697b3b4e6722be5857ad94fc87a88e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e9ec1a69656d3b80c85398",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹誓言也要继续奔跑，\n让大家看见未来。她告诉第一红宝石，\n想在“天鹅锦标”再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c35c453b3d89fbe4233197444117b8ab025c9d84215bb82475052298aca6ace0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc653b11e2639081d6c5ba09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时大拓太阳神突然闯入。\n她赞美着两人的表现，邀请她们到\n英里王者决定战“英里冠军赛”一较高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7542ae562f01e8017f2bddb4852e4a422d2c5b2c422ce50f227adad9bf29ada0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad967a6e405822b18acef82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石将“英里CS”订为\n下一个重大目标，期待届时\n能与劲敌们切磋琢磨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c6c9809a74dd96286c2d001fa10e0559b195e7585a4aca818cd1c4189551c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
