      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石绽放出最耀眼的光芒。\n她的母亲在那道光里看见“华丽一族”的\n新象征，而轻声说出为她感到骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80b2d75304ce7200b33caa3423b42e6312655ac5c0042729d639ff9590e3a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
