      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "全体观众皆带着敬意迎接第一红宝石。\n劲敌们赞扬她的表现，\n母亲也用掌声表达赞美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6592df7111ed7aa7d5766912b2b82a377ace8d4d8d884033cf668f892d14e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
